Module194093Name=TCMB Exchange Rates
Module194093Desc=Imports the Central Bank of Türkiye daily bulletin into Dolibarr multicurrency rates
TcmbKurSetup=TCMB Exchange Rates setup
TcmbKurSetupDesc=Rates come from the TCMB indicative rates bulletin (today.xml / archive) and are written into Dolibarr's own rate table through core classes. The bulletin is published on business days around 15:30 (TR); schedule the cron job after 16:00.
TcmbKurDailySync=TCMB daily rate update

TcmbKurSectionScope=Scope
TcmbKurSectionBehaviour=Behaviour

TCMBKUR_CURRENCIES=Currencies
TCMBKUR_CURRENCIESHelp=ISO codes, comma-separated (USD,EUR,GBP,CHF…). Codes missing from the bulletin are skipped and logged.
TCMBKUR_RATE_TYPE=Rate type
TCMBKUR_RATE_TYPEHelp=Turkish accounting normally uses Forex Buying (VUK 280). Average = (buying+selling)/2.
TCMBKUR_APPLY_NEXT_BUSINESS_DAY=Store the rate on the next business day
TCMBKUR_APPLY_NEXT_BUSINESS_DAYHelp=On: the bulletin dated D is stored with date D+1 (weekends skipped) — the bulletin applies to the next day's transactions. Off: stored with the bulletin date.
TCMBKUR_CROSS_RATES=Cross rates (main currency other than TRY)
TCMBKUR_CROSS_RATESHelp=When the company currency is EUR/USD etc., rates of the selected currencies and of TRY are derived from their TRY values in the bulletin.
TCMBKUR_ADD_MISSING_CURRENCY=Auto-add missing currencies
TCMBKUR_ADD_MISSING_CURRENCYHelp=Codes not yet defined in Dolibarr Multicurrency are created automatically.
TCMBKUR_SKIP_EXISTING=Skip when a rate exists for the date
TCMBKUR_SKIP_EXISTINGHelp=Off: a second rate row is added for the same day (Dolibarr uses the newest).
TCMBKUR_BACKFILL_DAYS=Backfill — default days
TCMBKUR_BACKFILL_DAYSHelp=Default for the "Backfill" button and the MCP tool.
TCMBKUR_HOLIDAY_LOOKBACK=Holiday look-back (days)
TCMBKUR_HOLIDAY_LOOKBACKHelp=When a date has no bulletin (holiday), walk back at most this many days.
TCMBKUR_TIMEOUT=HTTP timeout (s)
TCMBKUR_TIMEOUTHelp=Connect/response timeout for the TCMB server.
TCMBKUR_LOG_KEEP_DAYS=Keep run log (days)
TCMBKUR_LOG_KEEP_DAYSHelp=Run log entries older than this are purged. 0 = keep forever.

TcmbKurTypeForexBuying=Forex Buying
TcmbKurTypeForexSelling=Forex Selling
TcmbKurTypeBanknoteBuying=Banknote Buying
TcmbKurTypeBanknoteSelling=Banknote Selling
TcmbKurTypeForexAverage=Buying/Selling Average

